  "problem": "Which of the following statements are true in relation to the function $f(x)={5}^{x}?$\n\nI. Its range is $(-\\infty ,5).$\n\nII. $f(x)\\to 0$ as $x\\to -\\,\\infty .$\n\nIII. It's an increasing function.",
